{"kind": "finding", "id": "F-harness-seam-002-01", "file": "Source/Parsek.Tests/InGameTestRunnerTests.cs", "line": 547, "method": "InGameTestInfo_PerSceneHistory_SurvivesTopLevelStatusReset", "category": "T1", "severity": "Medium", "confidence": "high", "falsifiability": "falsifiability: Source/Parsek/InGameTests/InGameTestRunner.cs:1080; add t.ResultsByScene.Clear() to ResetResults -> stays green (the test mutates its own InGameTestInfo instead of calling ResetResults); nothing in InGameTestRunner reds it", "what_it_asserts": "After the test itself blanks Status/ErrorMessage/DurationMs on one InGameTestInfo, ResultsByScene still holds the stamped SPACECENTER result.", "why_weak": "It replays ResetResults' three assignments inline instead of calling InGameTestRunner.ResetResults (InGameTestRunner.cs:1080). The named contract - that the implicit pre-run reset preserves per-scene history - is unreachable from this body, so a ResetResults that started clearing ResultsByScene leaves the suite green.", "proposed_action": "Extract the per-test reset into an internal static helper (e.g. ResetLiveStatus(InGameTestInfo, bool clearSceneHistory)) called by ResetResults / ResetCategory / ClearAllSceneHistory, and drive the helper from this test.", "effort": "M", "july_ref": "none"}
{"kind": "finding", "id": "F-harness-seam-002-02", "file": "Source/Parsek.Tests/InGameTestRunnerTests.cs", "line": 568, "method": "InGameTestInfo_PerSceneHistory_ClearedByFullWipe", "category": "T1", "severity": "Low", "confidence": "high", "falsifiability": "falsifiability: Source/Parsek/InGameTests/InGameTestRunner.cs:1115; drop t.ResultsByScene.Clear() from ClearAllSceneHistory -> stays green; only the trailing FormatResultsReport assert can red, via InGameTestRunner.cs FormatResultsReport", "what_it_asserts": "After the test calls ResultsByScene.Clear() itself, the dict is empty and FormatResultsReport renders the test as (never run).", "why_weak": "ClearAllSceneHistory (InGameTestRunner.cs:1115) is never invoked, so the wipe contract cannot fail here; only the FormatResultsReport tail can red, and that is already pinned by FormatResultsReport_NeverRunTest_AppearsAsNeverRun (line 473).", "proposed_action": "Drive the same extracted reset helper with clearSceneHistory:true; keep the formatter assert or drop it as redundant.", "effort": "M", "july_ref": "none"}
{"kind": "coverage", "sut": "InGameTestRunner", "sut_file": "Source/Parsek/InGameTests/InGameTestRunner.cs", "sut_line": 1080, "case_kind": "state-transition", "proposed_name": "ResetLiveStatus_PreservesSceneHistory_ButFullWipeClearsIt", "sketch": "Extract the shared per-test reset body of ResetResults / ResetCategory / ClearAllSceneHistory into an internal static helper taking (InGameTestInfo, bool clearSceneHistory); drive it both ways over a test carrying two stamped ResultsByScene entries and assert the dict survives on false and is empty on true.", "guards": "A ResetResults regression that wipes per-scene history (collapsing the KSC->FLIGHT accumulation the export depends on) or a ClearAllSceneHistory that stops wiping it.", "risk": "ui"}
